  "description": "Qualify one Confluence page addressed by a same-origin page URL from a single body-free metadata read: report the identity, update stamp, and returned version the interface carried, decide current or stale against the recorded version the task holds, and report an explicitly restricted access state without treating a stale page as absent, without reading, quoting, or inferring page content, and without a second call.",
